            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova aneena na Mose, akĩmwĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩaĩe ana ma Isilaeli, ũmatavye, Nthembo yakwa, lĩu wakwa wa nthembo syakwa ila ivĩvaw’a na mwaki, ila syĩ mũuke mũseo kwakwa, mũkasũvĩe kũnthembea ĩvinda yĩla yasyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.8.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwa 8.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ali 3.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũkamea, Ĩno nĩyo nthembo ĩvĩvaw’a na mwaki ĩla mũkamũthembeaa Yeova: tutũlũme twa mwaka ũmwe tũte kĩema, twilĩ kĩla mũthenya, twĩthĩwe nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a ĩtatw’ĩkanaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.38+EXO.29.39+EXO.29.40+EXO.29.41+EXO.29.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuma 29.38–42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katũlũme kamwe ũkathembe kĩoko, na katũlũme kangĩ ũkathembe wĩoo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vamwe na kĩlungu kya ĩkũmi kya eva ya mũtu mũvinyu wĩthĩwe nthembo ya mũtu, ũvulanĩtw’e na kĩlungu kya kana kya ini ya mauta makime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩ nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a ĩtatw’ĩkanaa, ĩla yatw’ĩĩwe kĩĩmanĩ kya Sinai yĩthĩwe yĩ mũuke mũseo, nthembo ĩla ĩvĩvĩaw’a Yeova na mwaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nthembo ya kũnyuwa ya kũthembanĩsya nayo ĩkeethĩwa kĩlungu kya kana kya ini kwondũ wa katũlũme kamwe: nthĩnĩ wa vala vandũ vatheu ũkamwĩtĩe Yeova nthembo ya kũnyuwa ya mbinyu mbĩu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na katũlũme kala kangĩ ũkathembe wĩoo: o tondũ nthembo ya mũtu ya kĩoko, na nthembo ya kũnyuwa ya kũthembanĩsya nayo syathembiwe, ũkakathembe o ta ũu, nthembo ĩvĩvaw’a na mwaki, yĩ mũuke mũseo kwa Yeova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
